      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهَلَ</span></b> , said of a horse, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهِلَ</span></b>  (S, O, Msb, K)
and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهَلَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهِيلٌ</span>, (S, O, Msb, K,)
